<title>INDONESIA: Lippo Securities '96 net up sharply.</title>
<headline>Lippo Securities '96 net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian brokerage firm PT Lippo Securities said on Tuesday it posted an unaudited net profit of 40.4 billion rupiah in 1996 against 14.1 billion rupiah in 1995.</p>
<p>Lippo said in a statement it expected to post a net profit of 87.0 billion rupiah in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
